    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d64">

                <pb facs="0082" n="76" xml:id="pg76"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Gresham to Mr.
                            Denby.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 65.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-11-06"><hi rendition="#italic">November 6,
                        1894</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Prompted by that sincere friendship which the United States constantly desire to
                    show toward China, the President directs that you intimate his readiness to
                    tender his good offices toward bringing the present war with Japan to a close on
                    terms alike honorable to both nations should he be assured that such a tender
                    would be acceptable to both.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
